@startuml sm_009_hlc_clock
' ============================================================
' Title:     SM-009 Hybrid Logical Clock (HLC)
' Source:    docs/spec/contracts/data_stores/finding_events_store.yaml
' C4:        finding_events_repository → finding_events_store
' Package:   platform_infrastructure (HLC) · findings_infrastructure
' Deploy:    application StatefulSet PVC + DB watermark (topology only)
' Contract:  1.1.0
' ============================================================

title **SM-009 — Hybrid Logical Clock**\nC4: finding_events_repository → finding_events_store\n<size:12><i>Tick · wall-clock absorption · partition heal · PVC+watermark load</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Initialized : <b>HlcInitialized</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: init HLC node

state "Initialized" as Initialized #B9770E : **entry** pt=0 · lc=0 (cold start)\n**allowed** load persisted state\n**forbidden** emit without advance
state "Steady" as Steady #3B7DD8 : **entry** last emitted (pt, lc, node_id)\n**node_id** StatefulSet ordinal/pod_name (not Pod IP)\n**persist** PVC primary · DB watermark recovery authority\n**load** (pt,lc)=max(PVC, DB watermark) then fsync PVC\n**allowed** local send · remote receive\n**forbidden** decrease pt/lc · reuse retired node_id

' ---------- Hierarchical: single HLC tick (RTC step) ----------
state "Tick" as Tick #1B7A6E {
  ' Initial required (STM-026); deep targets LocalSend / RemoteReceive override
  [*] --> LocalSend
  state "Local Send" as LocalSend #1B7A6E : **entry** hlc_send(pt_wall)\n**allowed** advance or increment\n**forbidden** regress pt
  state "Remote Receive" as RemoteReceive #1B7A6E : **entry** hlc_receive(remote_pt, remote_lc, pt_wall)\n**allowed** merge max clocks\n**forbidden** overwrite committed events
  state "Advancing" as Advancing #2C6E49 : **entry** pt strictly advances\nlc resets to 0\n**allowed** emit new tuple
  state "Incrementing" as Incrementing #2C6E49 : **entry** pt unchanged · lc increments\nabsorbs wall regression / concurrency\n**allowed** emit new tuple
  state "Event Emitted" as EventEmitted #2C6E49 : **entry** event tagged (pt, lc, node_id)\nevent_hash = SHA-256(canonical_json minus hash)\n**allowed** persist tuple\n**forbidden** emit non-monotonic tuple

  LocalSend --> Advancing : <b>HlcAdvanced</b>\nactor: System\n[ptWallGreaterThanPt]\n/ ptNewEqualsWallLcZero()
  LocalSend --> Incrementing : <b>HlcIncremented</b>\nactor: System\n[ptWallLessOrEqualPt]\n/ ptUnchangedLcPlusOne()
  RemoteReceive --> Advancing : <b>HlcAdvanced</b>\nactor: System\n[maxClocksGreaterThanPt]\n/ ptNewEqualsMaxLcZero()
  RemoteReceive --> Incrementing : <b>HlcIncremented</b>\nactor: System\n[maxClocksEqualPt]\n/ ptUnchangedLcMaxPlusOne()
  Advancing --> EventEmitted : <b>HlcTupleEmitted</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: tag event with (pt_new, lc_new, node_id)
  Incrementing --> EventEmitted : <b>HlcTupleEmitted</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: tag event with (pt_new, lc_new, node_id)
  EventEmitted --> [*] : <b>TickCompleted</b>\nactor: System
}

' ---------- Hierarchical: partition heal ----------
state "Partition Heal" as PartitionHeal #A93226 {
  [*] --> Partitioned
  state "Partitioned" as Partitioned #A93226 : **entry** network partition\nlocal stream diverges\n**allowed** buffer · local emit\n**forbidden** assume global order
  state "Reconciling" as Reconciling #B9770E : **entry** merge remote stream\n**allowed** re-sort total order key\n**forbidden** overwrite committed
  Partitioned --> Reconciling : <b>HlcReconciling</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: merge buffered remote events
  Reconciling --> [*] : <b>HealCompleted</b>\nactor: System
}

Initialized --> Steady : <b>HlcStateLoaded</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: restore (pt, lc, node_id)\nfrom PVC primary; max(PVC, DB watermark)\n[reconcileNonDecreasing]

state "Resync" as Resync #B9770E : **entry** PVC stale or missing\n**allowed** fence old node_id · load DB max\n**forbidden** emit with stale PVC alone
state "Fenced" as Fenced #A93226 : **entry** node_id retired\n**allowed** register new node_id\n**forbidden** reuse retired node_id

Initialized --> Resync : <b>HlcPvcStaleOrMissing</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: detect PVC/DB divergence
Resync --> Steady : <b>HlcResynced</b>\nactor: System\n/ ptLcEqualsMax(pvc, finding_events_max)\n/ fsync before accept appends
Resync --> Fenced : <b>HlcNodeFenced</b>\nactor: System\n[pvcCorruptedOrLost]\n/ retire node_id in retired_nodes
Fenced --> Initialized : <b>HlcNewNodeIssued</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: node_id = StatefulSet pod_name stable id\n+ new UUID suffix if retired

Steady --> LocalSend : <b>HlcLocalSend</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: hlc_send
Steady --> RemoteReceive : <b>HlcRemoteReceive</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: hlc_receive
Steady --> PartitionHeal : <b>HlcPartitioned</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: heartbeat timeout

Tick --> Steady : <b>HlcStatePersisted</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: fsync (pt_new, lc_new) on PVC\n+ periodic DB watermark upsert\n[strictlyNonDecreasingVsPrior]
PartitionHeal --> Steady : <b>HlcReconciled</b>\nactor: System\n/ sortPhysicalTimeThenLcThenNodeThenEventId()\n/ advanceLocalHlcToMaxRemote()\n/ noOverwriteCommitted()

footer SM-009 · Contract 1.1.0 · finding_events_repository · Selma

@enduml
